m_assets/steam/apps/426190/extras/a97bb130e11a0b5c331e9018b69bbd32.webp?t=1624556805\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br>Two teams of 4 spawn on opposite sides of the randomly generated mine. Players must explore the map in search for gold, which can be used to purchase better weapons and equipment. Teams that collect more gold will generally have an edge in battle.<br><br>Teams collect points by killing enemy players, or neutral monsters. The team with the most points at the end of the round is victorious.<br><br>Gameplay is fast-paced, so hold onto your butts.",
